---
// Footer.astro - Pitch Midnight Footer: No Cards, No Gray Card Borders, No Border Radius
---

<footer class="bg-[#0a0e1a] text-white pt-20 pb-12 border-t border-white/10 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-[1586px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-9">
    
    <!-- Top Big Callout -->
    <div class="pb-16 mb-16 border-b border-white/10 flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center justify-between gap-8" data-aos="fade-up">
      <div class="max-w-2xl">
        <span class="category active mb-3">Mulai Simpan Lebih Cerdas</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">
          Hentikan Pemborosan Kuota. Coba Yonopod Sekarang.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-400 mt-3 text-base">
          Mulai dari Rp 10.000 saldo awal. Dapatkan penyimpanan bebas CORB dan tanpa ikatan kontrak.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
        <a href="#kalkulator-saldo" class="action-btn-primary !bg-[#06b6d4] !text-[#0a0e1a] hover:!bg-[#22d3ee] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider font-bold text-sm px-6 py-3.5" data-magnetic>
          Simulasi Saldo Top-Up
        </a>
        <a href="#" class="footer-back-top inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-3.5 bg-white/5 text-slate-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10 transition-all text-xs font-mono uppercase font-bold tracking-wider" data-magnetic>
          <span>Kembali ke Atas</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Middle Category Links Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 mb-16 pb-16 border-b border-white/10">
      <!-- Col 1: Brand Info -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <span class="font-bold text-xl tracking-tight text-white font-sans">YONOPOD</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed max-w-sm mb-6">
          Platform cloud storage berbasis web dengan skema fleksibel bayar sesuai penggunaan Rp 250/GB. Solusi penyimpanan adil dan terjangkau untuk pelajar, mahasiswa, dan UMKM di Indonesia.
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-slate-400">
          <a href="mailto:contact@yonopod.id">contact@yonopod.id</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 2: Fitur Utama -->
      <div>
        <div class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-[#06b6d4] font-bold mb-4">Fitur Platform</div>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm text-slate-400">
          <li><a href="#fitur" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Tag & Label Multi-Kategori</a></li>
          <li><a href="#fitur" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Folder Size Analyzer</a></li>
          <li><a href="#fitur" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Audit Log & Riwayat Aktivitas</a></li>
          <li><a href="#fitur" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Dashboard Monitoring Real-time</a></li>
          <li><a href="#fitur" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Tautan Berbagi & Keamanan</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 3: Solusi & Masa Depan -->
      <div>
        <div class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-[#06b6d4] font-bold mb-4">Inovasi & Tarif</div>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm text-slate-400">
          <li><a href="#kalkulator-saldo" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Simulasi Saldo Rp 250/GB</a></li>
          <li><a href="#solusi" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Solusi Masalah CORB</a></li>
          <li><a href="#inovasi-mendatang" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Embed On Web (Widget)</a></li>
          <li><a href="#inovasi-mendatang" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Video Streaming HLS</a></li>
          <li><a href="#inovasi-mendatang" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Cloudflare Edge CDN</a></li>
          <li><a href="#arsitektur" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Spesifikasi Server 3-Tier</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 4: Keamanan & Roadmap -->
      <div>
        <div class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-[#06b6d4] font-bold mb-4">Tata Kelola & Rencana</div>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-sm text-slate-400">
          <li><a href="#roadmap" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Fase 1: MVP Launch</a></li>
          <li><a href="#roadmap" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Fase 2: Monetisasi 2 TB</a></li>
          <li><a href="#roadmap" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Fase 3: Pemutar Media & Sync</a></li>
          <li><a href="#roadmap" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Fase 4: B2B Enterprise</a></li>
          <li><a href="#faq" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Pusat Bantuan & FAQ</a></li>
          <li><a href="#arsitektur" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Proteksi Cloudflare Pro</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Row: Copyright & Credentials -->
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-slate-500 font-mono">
      <div>
        &copy; 2026 PT. Alenerlverse Nexus Technology. Hak Cipta Dilindungi Undang-Undang.
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</footer>

<script>
  // Smooth scroll back to top
  document.querySelector('.footer-back-top')?.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
    e.preventDefault();
    window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: 'smooth' });
  });
</script>
